        {
          "text": " Kisha Musa akamtafuta sana huyo mbuzi wa sadaka ya dhambi, naye, tazama, alikuwa amekwisha kuteketezwa; naye akawakasirikia hao Eleazari na Ithamari, wana wa Haruni, hao waliobaki, akawaambia, ",
